# Time-stamped audit output directories at the repo root.
# Already-tracked files in earlier audit-YYYY-MM-DD/ dirs (audit-2026-05-11,
# audit-2026-05-12) are unaffected — git keeps tracked files even when an
# ignore rule would match them. New audits should reference local-only.
